  "summary": [
    "FR-007 formal references use Markdown reference-link definitions with a content hash and DLID in the title",
    "FR-009 link checks verify the target by searching the referenced directory, not stored state",
    "FR-010 path-fix notification and lookup of moved documents within the Index target list",
    "Section 13.1 gives every heading a section ID DLID issued only by the DLID assignment operation",
    "FR-013 to FR-015 enumerate change impact candidates by reverse lookup and keep no notification state",
    "Project management AI rewrites titles hashes after verifying; doc-link never writes them",
    "FR-016 lists inconsistencies such as missing IDs, duplicates, broken references, and hash mismatches",
    "Rewrites of user documents require user confirmation of a list before applying",
    "Check results return counts on stdout and full details in a work file",
    "Acceptance criteria AC-003 to AC-035 cover path mismatch, impact, and detail files"
  ],
  "tasks": [
    "Implementing link checking",
